\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Benchmark flow for the CMA clinical retrieval study. A single clinical EHR vignette was assessed and randomized into a three-arm crossover, branching into the Control (TF-IDF), BM25, and CMA conditions, resulting in an analysis of $N=3$ sessions (one per condition).}}{15}{}\protected@file@percent }
